WEBVTT

00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:04.980
<b>Higehiro: After Being Rejected, 
I Shaved and Took in a High School Runaway</b>

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:11.260
Excuse me.

00:00:10.190 --> 00:00:15.200
"Future"

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:19.420
Sayu...

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:25.670
I'm going, too.

00:00:28.930 --> 00:00:29.710
I see.

00:00:31.110 --> 00:00:34.790
You talked to her. Now it's my turn.

00:00:37.030 --> 00:00:40.140
I need to face her, or nothing will change.

00:00:40.860 --> 00:00:41.840
Yeah...

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:42.870
So...

00:00:44.950 --> 00:00:46.230
I'm going to give it a shot.

00:00:46.230 --> 00:00:48.120
Okay, good luck.

00:00:55.660 --> 00:00:57.780
Now it's your turn, huh?

00:00:57.780 --> 00:00:59.330
What is it with you people?

00:01:08.070 --> 00:01:12.710
I'm sorry for causing trouble.

00:01:15.080 --> 00:01:19.780
To be honest, I had years of frustration 
toward you that had built up.

00:01:21.080 --> 00:01:22.700
That's why I left home.

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:30.330
But that caused problems for you, 
my brother, and others.

00:01:30.330 --> 00:01:31.860
That's the truth.

00:01:32.320 --> 00:01:35.690
So... I'm sorry.

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:44.040
I won't apologize. 
I'm not going to apologize!

00:01:46.370 --> 00:01:51.590
Because... Because I don't even know 
when it started to be a mistake!

00:01:54.840 --> 00:01:57.500
But what he said really shook me.

00:01:59.280 --> 00:02:02.640
I'm the only parent you have, aren't I?

00:02:09.810 --> 00:02:10.600
Yeah.

00:02:11.450 --> 00:02:12.380
Yeah...

00:02:16.040 --> 00:02:19.130
Stay here, and work hard until you graduate.

00:02:19.880 --> 00:02:22.090
You're definitely being held back a year.

00:02:22.090 --> 00:02:22.880
Yeah...

00:02:22.880 --> 00:02:25.700
You can do whatever you want after that.

00:02:32.240 --> 00:02:33.450
Thank you.

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:46.980
Sayu.

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:48.600
Yoshida-san...

00:02:50.130 --> 00:02:52.120
It wasn't a long talk,

00:02:52.120 --> 00:02:54.820
but I was able to have a calm conversation 
with my mother for the first time.

00:02:58.230 --> 00:02:59.380
I see.

00:03:04.020 --> 00:03:05.380
I'm glad.

00:03:13.320 --> 00:03:16.100
That's the end of my job, huh?

00:04:00.470 --> 00:04:02.460
What are you doing, Sayu?

00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:04.010
You found me, huh?

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:08.160
It's our last day together, 
so I thought we should sleep together.

00:04:08.160 --> 00:04:10.420
You said that at my place, too.

00:04:11.010 --> 00:04:12.440
Did I?

00:04:12.440 --> 00:04:14.820
Well, whatever.

00:04:15.690 --> 00:04:18.120
Yoshida-san, don't look this way.

00:04:20.080 --> 00:04:21.570
What are you doing?

00:04:22.010 --> 00:04:25.030
Aw, come on. 
It's our last night together.

00:04:25.640 --> 00:04:27.200
Listen...

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:30.910
Do you think you can get away with anything 
as long as you say it's our last night?

00:04:30.910 --> 00:04:32.250
Am I turning you on?

00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:33.300
Don't be stupid.

00:04:40.720 --> 00:04:43.380
You asked me if I could stand on my own.

00:04:43.380 --> 00:04:46.240
But I don't want to leave you.

00:04:46.240 --> 00:04:49.090
You won't have to do chores every day.

00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:51.480
And you've got a reliable
brother to help you out.

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:54.060
You'll be fine.

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:59.020
I didn't mind doing the chores 
at your place at all.

00:04:59.020 --> 00:04:59.980
Really?

00:05:00.410 --> 00:05:01.210
Yeah.

00:05:02.710 --> 00:05:05.320
I was happy. Really.

00:05:11.030 --> 00:05:13.500
Yoshida-san, turn this way.

00:05:14.440 --> 00:05:15.910
What?

00:05:20.950 --> 00:05:27.090
Well, um... It's our last night...

00:05:28.450 --> 00:05:29.510
Yeah.

00:05:30.550 --> 00:05:32.170
So, um...

00:05:33.030 --> 00:05:35.720
Want to do it, at least once?

00:05:37.100 --> 00:05:38.060
Do what?

00:05:38.590 --> 00:05:40.770
Well, you know...

00:05:41.600 --> 00:05:44.230
S-Sex.

00:05:44.830 --> 00:05:46.670
What are you talking about?

00:05:46.670 --> 00:05:49.450
Well, you know...

00:05:49.880 --> 00:05:54.540
So we won't forget each other.

00:06:02.850 --> 00:06:03.990
Yoshida-san.

00:06:04.740 --> 00:06:07.940
You don't have to do that. 
You know I won't forget you.

00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:13.450
We spent over half a year together.

00:06:14.150 --> 00:06:19.500
A man and woman who aren't lovers or family 
spent over half a year together.

00:06:21.800 --> 00:06:22.820
Yeah...

00:06:25.600 --> 00:06:28.220
I pretty sure I'll never forget that.

00:06:31.440 --> 00:06:34.280
Yeah, I won't, either!

00:06:37.270 --> 00:06:42.750
You know, I always thought...
you don't look like it, but you're a crybaby, huh?

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:47.100
Shut up. I can't help it. Too many wonderful
things have been happening lately.

00:06:47.490 --> 00:06:49.750
O-Ow!

00:06:51.860 --> 00:06:56.520
But do you at least want to feel up my boobs 
while you have the chance?

00:06:58.660 --> 00:07:00.070
Give it up.

00:07:27.120 --> 00:07:30.720
You didn't have to take me 
all the way here.

00:07:30.720 --> 00:07:33.500
We owe you a lot.

00:07:33.500 --> 00:07:34.930
Let us do this, at least.

00:07:34.930 --> 00:07:36.360
That's right.

00:07:41.860 --> 00:07:42.520
Sayu.

00:07:44.200 --> 00:07:49.160
I need to talk to Yoshida-san for a minute. 
Can you go on ahead?

00:07:49.160 --> 00:07:50.390
To Yoshida-san?

00:07:52.990 --> 00:07:54.300
Got it.

00:07:58.550 --> 00:08:00.120
Thank you.

00:08:00.120 --> 00:08:02.990
I wanted one last chance to talk to you.

00:08:02.990 --> 00:08:04.250
Me, too.

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:05.040
First...

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:07.630
Take this.

00:08:07.930 --> 00:08:09.370
What is this?

00:08:09.370 --> 00:08:11.120
The fare for the airplane ticket back.

00:08:11.120 --> 00:08:14.800
No, you already paid for the ticket here.

00:08:14.800 --> 00:08:17.640
And I already got the ticket.

00:08:17.640 --> 00:08:19.390
It was really cheap.

00:08:21.780 --> 00:08:25.770
I'm sorry it's the most I can do, 
but it's my way of thanking you.

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:28.750
No, I really appreciate it.

00:08:28.750 --> 00:08:30.120
But...

00:08:30.120 --> 00:08:36.490
But if you insist, use that money 
to buy Sayu some new clothes.

00:08:40.480 --> 00:08:41.700
Understood.

00:08:43.810 --> 00:08:46.710
Come see Sayu when you have time.

00:08:54.370 --> 00:08:58.100
Yoshida-san, you're in love
with Sayu, aren't you?

00:08:59.430 --> 00:09:01.980
That's impossible.

00:09:01.980 --> 00:09:04.960
She's a teenager! A teenager!

00:09:04.960 --> 00:09:08.160
I don't think age matters 
when it comes to love.

00:09:08.160 --> 00:09:11.550
I like older women.

00:09:11.550 --> 00:09:12.820
Is that right?

00:09:12.820 --> 00:09:14.680
It is.

00:09:14.680 --> 00:09:16.830
So stop. It's not funny.

00:09:16.830 --> 00:09:19.530
Well, if you insist.

00:09:21.400 --> 00:09:25.910
But... thanks to you, 
Sayu was finally able to move forward.

00:09:27.080 --> 00:09:29.190
Because she met you.

00:09:30.340 --> 00:09:35.670
Nobody but you could've made this happen.

00:09:36.620 --> 00:09:41.020
I'm sure you didn't mean to encounter her.

00:09:41.510 --> 00:09:45.750
But on the day you did, 
if you hadn't been drunk first,

00:09:46.230 --> 00:09:49.130
if you'd gone home a little earlier...

00:09:49.720 --> 00:09:52.150
You might've never met her.

00:09:54.150 --> 00:09:57.110
But even so, I can't help but thank you.

00:09:58.640 --> 00:10:04.080
Thank you for finding Sayu.

00:10:06.050 --> 00:10:07.020
Yeah.

00:10:08.600 --> 00:10:12.060
And this may just be my own ego speaking,

00:10:13.070 --> 00:10:21.500
but if meeting Sayu had as much meaning 
for your life as it did for hers,

00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:24.980
that would be a very happy thing, I think.

00:10:27.700 --> 00:10:30.390
Well, I'll tell her you said that.

00:10:31.310 --> 00:10:34.170
Yes, that would be for the best.

00:10:36.680 --> 00:10:38.200
Stay well.

00:10:38.200 --> 00:10:40.240
Yes, you too.

00:10:41.000 --> 00:10:44.960
Tell Sayu I'll be waiting in the car.

00:10:44.960 --> 00:10:46.200
Sure.

00:10:57.920 --> 00:11:00.860
It's back to work tomorrow, huh?

00:11:00.860 --> 00:11:02.550
Let's come back here 
next time we get some vacation.

00:11:04.420 --> 00:11:05.310
I see.

00:11:05.720 --> 00:11:07.610
My brother said that.

00:11:07.610 --> 00:11:08.780
Yeah.

00:11:08.780 --> 00:11:09.640
Is that all?

00:11:10.020 --> 00:11:12.380
He said something else, right?

00:11:12.380 --> 00:11:13.980
You were talking a long time.

00:11:17.170 --> 00:11:18.940
More importantly, Sayu.

00:11:19.280 --> 00:11:22.100
Why are you still wearing your uniform?

00:11:22.760 --> 00:11:23.910
Because...

00:11:24.850 --> 00:11:26.070
Because?

00:11:27.030 --> 00:11:27.950
It's a secret.

00:11:30.530 --> 00:11:32.920
I don't get teenage girls.

00:11:38.790 --> 00:11:45.530
<i>This is a message from Nine Air to passengers 
departing to Haneda Airport in Tokyo.</i>

00:11:46.180 --> 00:11:51.200
<i>Flight NNA231 is now boarding.</i>

00:11:50.180 --> 00:11:52.850
It's finally time, huh?

00:11:51.200 --> 00:11:54.460
<i>If you have not passed the security checkpoint, 
please do so now.</i>

00:11:55.460 --> 00:11:56.460
Yeah.

00:11:57.340 --> 00:12:03.450
Um... Even if I'm not there, 
make sure you do your chores.

00:12:03.790 --> 00:12:05.740
I know.

00:12:06.470 --> 00:12:08.660
Work hard at high school.

00:12:08.660 --> 00:12:10.420
Yeah, I will.

00:12:15.650 --> 00:12:16.730
Yoshida-san!

00:12:19.360 --> 00:12:21.820
I'm glad I ran away.

00:12:23.380 --> 00:12:25.800
Because I ran into you.

00:12:29.510 --> 00:12:32.680
I've been thinking ever since
I came back to Hokkaido.

00:12:33.410 --> 00:12:37.660
What would've happened 
if I'd met you a different way...

00:12:38.420 --> 00:12:41.590
As classmates, or maybe if
you were an upperclassman at school,

00:12:42.020 --> 00:12:43.450
or maybe even part of my family.

00:12:44.720 --> 00:12:48.280
But none of them felt right.

00:12:50.870 --> 00:12:56.120
I'm glad I met the man you are, 
not a classmate or a member of my family.

00:12:56.520 --> 00:13:02.630
Now that I'm wearing my uniform, 
I can feel like I'm really glad I met you.

00:13:05.190 --> 00:13:06.310
Me, too.

00:13:07.000 --> 00:13:09.140
I'm glad I met you, too.

00:13:09.650 --> 00:13:12.680
I feel like I understand myself 
a little better now.

00:13:13.370 --> 00:13:14.620
Yeah?

00:13:14.620 --> 00:13:15.430
Yeah.

00:13:17.350 --> 00:13:19.340
Hey, Yoshida-san.

00:13:21.170 --> 00:13:23.650
I love you.

00:13:25.200 --> 00:13:26.760
Are you serious?

00:13:26.760 --> 00:13:27.610
Yeah.

00:13:29.170 --> 00:13:31.670
I'm serious.

00:13:35.280 --> 00:13:39.040
Don't make me repeat myself. 
I'm not into kids.

00:13:40.850 --> 00:13:43.880
You're cute. I really think so.

00:13:44.450 --> 00:13:47.480
But I really can't see you that way.

00:13:49.520 --> 00:13:52.220
I see. Then...

00:13:53.680 --> 00:13:55.730
When I'm not a kid anymore, 
do I have a chance?

00:14:00.210 --> 00:14:04.190
Once you're a full-fledged member of society, 
you might have a shot.

00:14:05.960 --> 00:14:07.080
Then wait for me.

00:14:07.080 --> 00:14:08.550
I won't.

00:14:09.550 --> 00:14:14.020
If I have to wait for you, 
I'll be an old man.

00:14:16.760 --> 00:14:18.920
You've got a long life ahead of you.

00:14:19.520 --> 00:14:23.880
You can think about your adult life 
once you're all grown up.

00:14:23.880 --> 00:14:31.110
So put your memories of me into a
box somewhere, and enjoy your new life.

00:14:32.630 --> 00:14:34.020
I can't.

00:14:36.770 --> 00:14:39.620
I can't do that.

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:46.810
These memories are too big 
to fit into a box!

00:14:55.810 --> 00:15:00.120
Even if you don't wait for me, 
I'll come see you again!

00:15:11.720 --> 00:15:13.080
Okay.

00:15:25.850 --> 00:15:28.090
You're as big a crybaby as ever, 
aren't you?

00:15:28.090 --> 00:15:32.640
Shut up! And your facial hair looks 
as bad on you as ever!

00:15:32.640 --> 00:15:34.330
I didn't ask for your opinion on it.

00:15:39.490 --> 00:15:40.760
Okay, bye.

00:15:40.760 --> 00:15:43.330
Yeah, I'll see you again.

00:15:44.520 --> 00:15:45.660
Yeah.

00:15:46.230 --> 00:15:47.450
You will.

00:15:51.810 --> 00:15:53.430
Okay, you're all set.

00:15:57.590 --> 00:15:59.310
Let me see your ticket.

00:15:59.310 --> 00:16:01.870
Huh? That's strange, I was sure I had it.

00:16:01.870 --> 00:16:04.060
Whew, we just made it!

00:16:04.060 --> 00:16:06.760
Because your dumb ass overslept!

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:26.070
I'm all set.

00:16:27.020 --> 00:16:28.000
Let's go.

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:28.700
Yeah.

00:16:33.270 --> 00:16:36.050
Did you say all the things 
you wanted to say for the last time?

00:16:36.930 --> 00:16:41.270
Nope. It's not the last time.

00:16:41.580 --> 00:16:42.680
I see.

00:16:46.700 --> 00:16:48.890
Then you'll have to work hard.

00:16:49.510 --> 00:16:50.280
Yeah.

00:16:55.350 --> 00:16:57.160
I'm home.

00:17:31.520 --> 00:17:36.200
<b>I'll leave you my scent, 
so remember me forever. 
Sayu</b>

00:17:43.300 --> 00:17:46.970
It smells like the detergent we always buy.

00:17:50.340 --> 00:17:53.340
<b>Easy to Make!
Recipe Notebook</b>

00:17:53.340 --> 00:17:56.710
Man, I can cook even without this thing.

00:18:11.090 --> 00:18:12.950
It's no good.

00:18:14.290 --> 00:18:18.380
The miso soup she made tasted so good.

00:18:26.960 --> 00:18:30.900
I'm the one who's not okay.

00:18:38.240 --> 00:18:41.620
I guess I'm the real kid here.

00:20:14.150 --> 00:20:16.560
I sent you the planning document, Senpai.

00:20:16.940 --> 00:20:20.380
I'm sorry it's close to the deadline, 
but please take a look at it.

00:20:20.380 --> 00:20:21.030
Sure.

00:20:21.760 --> 00:20:26.030
I can't believe Mishima-chan's 
getting to lead such a big project.

00:20:27.460 --> 00:20:29.910
Two years ago, 
that would've been impossible.

00:20:30.390 --> 00:20:33.750
All that time I spent mentoring her 
is finally paying off.

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:35.500
Yup, yup!

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:37.960
Um... Isn't that going a bit far?

00:20:39.160 --> 00:20:42.170
When you started, 
you were slacking as hard as you could.

00:20:43.080 --> 00:20:44.280
That's right.

00:20:44.280 --> 00:20:48.440
Um... I guess I have a different mentality 
from what I did then.

00:20:48.440 --> 00:20:49.470
You do, huh?

00:20:49.470 --> 00:20:50.140
Yes!

00:20:51.330 --> 00:20:54.280
Okay, looks all right.

00:20:54.280 --> 00:20:55.930
Go for it.

00:20:55.930 --> 00:20:57.310
Thank you!

00:20:58.550 --> 00:21:03.820
By the way, if I have trouble, 
I'll still come running to you as fast as I can!

00:21:03.820 --> 00:21:05.530
Seriously, huh?

00:21:05.530 --> 00:21:06.520
Yeah.

00:21:06.520 --> 00:21:08.330
Good work, everyone.

00:21:09.280 --> 00:21:10.810
Thank you.

00:21:10.810 --> 00:21:14.470
This is sudden, but are you
guys all free tonight?

00:21:15.110 --> 00:21:16.690
Why?

00:21:16.690 --> 00:21:21.300
I thought we could go get a bite to eat 
to celebrate Mishima-san's new project.

00:21:21.300 --> 00:21:22.830
Hooray!

00:21:22.830 --> 00:21:25.400
Sorry, I'm busy today.

00:21:25.400 --> 00:21:27.260
That's a shame.

00:21:27.880 --> 00:21:30.670
So it'll be just the three of us today.

00:21:30.670 --> 00:21:31.460
Yup.

00:21:32.360 --> 00:21:36.180
I'll invite Yoshida-kun some other time.

00:21:37.940 --> 00:21:39.340
Yoshida-senpai!

00:21:40.070 --> 00:21:42.820
You owe me a date, too.

00:21:43.520 --> 00:21:45.360
What's her problem?

00:21:45.360 --> 00:21:47.690
You meeting Asami-chan today?

00:21:47.690 --> 00:21:48.490
Yeah.

00:21:48.490 --> 00:21:50.780
She wants me to read her novel again.

00:21:52.800 --> 00:21:55.320
She's cute, too, huh?

00:21:55.320 --> 00:21:56.750
Quiet.

00:21:57.750 --> 00:21:59.710
<i>Where are you now, Yoshida-san?</i>

00:21:59.710 --> 00:22:02.410
<i>You're not working late, are you?</i>

00:22:02.410 --> 00:22:04.000
I'm not.

00:22:04.000 --> 00:22:05.550
I'm heading home.

00:22:05.550 --> 00:22:07.260
<i>Okay, okay.</i>

00:22:07.260 --> 00:22:10.820
<i>You'll be there in about
three minutes then, right?</i>

00:22:10.820 --> 00:22:13.510
Are you there already?

00:22:13.510 --> 00:22:17.230
I am. So hurry.

00:22:17.530 --> 00:22:20.510
Oh, you don't need to stop 
at a convenience store or anything.

00:22:20.510 --> 00:22:23.310
And you didn't buy dinner, did you?

00:22:23.310 --> 00:22:25.770
<i>I wouldn't waste the money on you.</i>

00:22:25.770 --> 00:22:28.940
Great. Okay, see you soon.

00:22:36.370 --> 00:22:38.920
Jeez... What's her problem?

00:23:15.330 --> 00:23:18.590
Hey, you. What are you
doing out at this hour?

00:23:18.590 --> 00:23:20.080
Go home!

00:23:23.320 --> 00:23:26.800
I have a home to go to, 
but it's very far away.

00:23:28.260 --> 00:23:29.260
So...

00:23:31.060 --> 00:23:32.900
Let me stay at your place, mister!

00:23:36.560 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>Next time, let me stay at your place!</b>
